    "updated_at": "2025-09-11T23:51:26Z",
    "body": "I agree that this is a missing part of the spec, we should do that in generate implied end tags.\n\nIt also makes me wonder if any other end tag rules for other elements are missing in generate implied end tags, and if the fix should be more generic to run end tag rules for any tag that gets closed in generate implied end tags.",
